1.bug_scenario:
In both Dropdown and MultiSelect React components, attaching a ref via forwardRef always yields null or undefined. In the reproduction (Codesandbox) the user does:

  const dropdownRef = useRef();
  <Dropdown ref={dropdownRef} ... />
  useEffect(() => console.log(dropdownRef.current));

but dropdownRef.current is undefined. The same occurs for MultiSelect. The underlying DOM or component instance is never assigned to the forwarded ref.
